      "addedAt": "2026-08-14T09:38:41.006Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "content": "標誌豐田別克 ",
      "length": 7,
      "addedAt": "2026-08-14T09:38:41.006Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "content": "你負責貌美如花，我負責插花 ",
      "length": 14,
      "addedAt": "2026-08-14T09:38:41.006Z"
    },
    {
